ss=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拿起；捡起；采纳；提出；接受；听取；质疑；指摘；批评；报道；刊登；刊播；夺取；没收；剥夺；撤销；取消资格；接生；助产；征收；收取</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93024\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はガラスの<ruby>花瓶<rp>(</rp><rt>かびん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她拿起玻璃瓶。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（按钮、把手、盖子等）脱落；松开；（发热、疼痛、肿胀等）消退；消失；（污渍）褪去；（灰尘等）脱落；（皱纹等）消除；被收获；被采摘；被生产；（鱼等）被捕获；被获得；被提取；被解释为；被理解为；被看作；（平衡、和谐等）得以实现；得以达成；能够获得；能够得到；能够取得；能够赢得；能够捕到</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227468\">オリーブの<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>油<rp>(</rp><rt>あぶら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可以从橄榄的果实中取出油。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">トン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">吨（尤指公制吨，即1000千克）；公吨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とんでもない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">荒唐；离谱；不可思议；令人震惊；骇人听闻；可怕；绝对不行！；哪里的话！；不可能！；荒唐至极！；真是过分！；没门儿！；哪里的话；不客气；别这么说；不麻烦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90827\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>歌手<rp>(</rp><rt>かしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だなんてとんでもない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不好意思,她是歌手。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">トンネル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">隧道；隧穿；（粒子）穿透势垒；滚地球从腿间漏过；漏接滚地球</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183136\"><ruby>汽車<rp>(</rp><rt>きしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はトンネルを<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火车穿过隧道。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同一</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どういつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相同；一致；同一；相等；平等；公平对待；无差别</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123689\"><ruby>同一<rp>(</rp><rt>どういつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>現象<rp>(</rp><rt>げんしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>観察<rp>(</rp><rt>かんさつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">相同的现象被观察到。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どうか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=