=\"ja\">同僚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同事；同僚；合作者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101641\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>同僚<rp>(</rp><rt>どうりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となかなか<ruby>打<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不能和同事做得太好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">道路</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">道路；公路</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211693\">その<ruby>崖<rp>(</rp><rt>がけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>道路<rp>(</rp><rt>どうろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>突<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个岩石在道路上升起。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">毒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">毒；毒物；毒液；危害；恶劣影响；恶意；怨恨；仇恨；辱骂性语言；恶言</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222361\">この<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>毒<rp>(</rp><rt>どく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这鱼没毒。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2031423\" title=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">読書</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どくしょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">读书</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83033\"><ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>はは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はメガネなしでは<ruby>読書<rp>(</rp><rt>どくしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有眼镜就不能读书了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">独身</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どくしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">未婚；单身</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109918\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>一生<rp>(</rp><rt>いっしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>独身<rp>(</rp><rt>どくしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ごした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他一生都独自一人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">独特</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どくとく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">独特；独有；特殊性；只有自己才能理解的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213920\">そういう<ruby>習慣<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>米国人<rp>(</rp><rt>べいこくじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>独特<rp>(</rp><rt>どくとく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这种习惯对美国人来说并不独特。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">独立</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どくりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">独立；自力更生；自给自足；自立；独立；自由；分离；孤立</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"86286\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>両親<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>独立<rp>(</rp><rt>どくりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她与父母独立。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どこか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">某处；某地；在某些方面；在某种程度上</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201044\">どこかおかしいと<ruby>一目<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはわかりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在某个地方看起来很奇怪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土曜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">星期六；周六</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124484\"><ruby>土曜<rp>(</rp><rt>どよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">星期六有学校吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドライブ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">兜风；驾车旅行；驾驶；（去）兜风；开车出游；驾驶（汽车等）；推动；驱动（创新、变革等）；（计算机）驱动器；磁盘驱动器</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199759\">ドライブするのはどうですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如何开车?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドラマ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">电视剧；电视连续剧；电视戏剧；话剧；戏剧；戏剧性事件；壮观场面；悲剧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199079\">ナポレオンの<ruby>一生<rp>(</rp><rt>いっしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすばらしいドラマだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">拿破仑的一生是一部很棒的戏剧。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">努力</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どりょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">努力；尽力；奋力</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97844\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こうと<ruby>努力<rp>(</rp><rt>どりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他试图解决这个问题。</span></div></li>"]